As per feng shui element, Geo will be made up of 3 towers – 2 residential and 1 retail. There will be a total of 736 residential units, each of them 30 storey high. There are several types of layout and sizes to choose from, the smallest being 655 sft and the largest unit is 1,035 sft.\nThe 30-storeys residential tower overlooks the spectacular view of the award-winning Kota Permai Golf & Country Club and Bukit Kemuning Golf & Country Club.\nSurrounding Geo, in the establish Bukit Rimau township, there are plenty of amenities and services in which residents can get access. Aside from that, neighbouring townships also host an array of amenities such as shopping malls, eateries, banks, entertainment services, telecommunications, supermarkets, to name just a few.\nWithin Geo itself, there are 3 levels dedicated to facilities for residents’ use including a SkyGarden on level 30, which overs panoramic views.\n\n#### Geo@Bukit Rimau Concept & Concept\n\nGeo is designed according to the Geomancy principles and is feng shui inspired. The freehold service residence is the tallest within 10 km radius. It has a spectacular view of award-winning Kota Permai Golf & Country Club and Bukit Kemuning Golf & Country Club, a top its Sky Garden on level 30. Geo offers unparallel facilities for its residents’ which takes up 3 levels within the residential tower. Geo within the established and well-planned township of Bukit Rimau and neighbouring Kota Kemuning, both of which boasts a myriad of amenities. The property is within self-sustaining township of Bukit Rimau.\n\n#### Geo@Bukit Rimau Accessibility & Amenities\n\nGeo@ Bukit Rimau can be easily reached via KESAS highway, Federal Highway, Kemuning-Shah Alam Expressway (LKSA), North-South Expressway Central Link (ELITE) and Damansara-Puchong Expressway (LDP). As mentioned, Geo is located within the well-established and well-planned Bukit Rimau township and neighbours Kota Kemuning, both of these established townships offer a myriad of amenities such as dining, shopping, retail, telecommunications and an abundance of green spaces. Nearby schools include Chinese Taipei School Kuala Lumpur, Sekolah Kebangsaan Bukit Rimau and Sekolah Kebangsaan Bukit Kemuning. For groceries, residents can head to AEON Big Bukit Rimau, Hero Market and Econsave Bukit Kemuning whilst residents can head to nearby Gamuda Walk for some retail therapy. Within Bukit Rimau and neighbouring Kota Kemuning are plenty of green spaces for residents to relax whilst for golfers, award-winning Kota Permai Golf & Country Club and Kota Kemuning Golf & Country Club are within a distance. As for food, residents are spoilt for choice with an array of mouthwatering selection such as Dole’s Restaurant, Ping Wah, Go Noodle House, Warung Cik Mun, Nando’s, Rakuzen, Mohd Chan and Cravings Restaurant, not to forget fast food such as KFC and Pizza Hut, all of which are within Bukit Rimau and neighbouring Kota Kemuning. Columbia Hospital Bukit Rimau is also located within the township of Bukit Rimau.\n\n#### Geo @ Bukit Rimau Facilities & Project Information\n\nGeo@Bukit Rimau boasts 3 levels of unparallel recreational facilities for its residents including a Rooftop SkyGarden perched high up on Level 30 of the residential tower. On level 7 is the wading pool, Garden Kitchen, Multipurpose hall, Mini Cinema, Spa lounge, Spa pool, Yoga deck, Garden pavilion deck, vertical garden, reading room, urban garden, steam room and surau, whilst level 8 houses yet another wading pool, waterfall, leisure pool, lap pool, gym, vertical garden, pool deck and a covered deck. On Level 30, there is the Sky Garden, Rooftop Sky Lounge, Outdoor kitchen and outdoor dining area. On the ground level, which is also the lobby floor is the retail shops, 24 hours security and kindergarten. All 3 residential and retails blocks have looks out to different views – Block A faces Northwest with views of Bandar Botanic and Bukit Tinggi, Block B faces Southwest with views of Bukit Kemuning & Country Club whilst Block C which faces East overlooks the Lake and Kota Permai Golf & Country Club. There are 4 layout types to choose from. Type A is the smallest with sizes of 655 sft and 685 sft and has 2 bedrooms and 2 baths. Type B & Chas 3 bedrooms and 2 baths with a built -up pf 875 sft, whilst Type D is 1,035 sft with 4 rooms and 3 baths as well as a dual key concept.\n\n#### Geo @ Bukit Rimau Launching Details\n\nThe launching price of Geo is from 380,000 onwards. At present, selling price is between RM 400,00-RM 652,100 respectively.\nAmongst the projects by the same developer include, Rimba Residence Puchong. Nearby projects to take note of include, Pangsapuri Subang Suria, Trefoil @ Setia City, Emira Residence @ Shah Alam, Denai Alam and Suria Jelutong.\n\n## Common facilities\n\nImage: security-access-control-o24-hour security  | Image: bbq-oBBQ\nImage: gym-oGym  | Image: jacuzzi-oJacuzzi\nImage: shared-space-oMulti-purpose hall  | Image: playground-oPlayground\nImage: sauna-oSauna  | Image: sunbed-oSky Lounge\nImage: pray-oSurau - Male & Female  | Image: swim-oSwimming pool\nImage: swim-oWading pool\n\n## Building details\n\nBuilding  | # Floors  | # Units\n--- | --- | ---\nBlock A Geo@Bukit Rimau  | N/A  | N/A\nBlock B Geo@Bukit Rimau  | N/A  | N/A\nBlock C Geo@Bukit Rimau  | N/A  | N/A\n\n## Customer reviews\n\n0.0 out of 5\n\nBased on 0 reviews\n\nWrite a Review\n\n* * *\n\n* * *\n\n## FAQs\n\n##### What are the selling prices in Geo Bukit Rimau?\n\nSelling prices in Geo Bukit Rimau start from RM 400,000.\n\n##### What is the PSF for Geo Bukit Rimau?\n\nThe current PSF range in Geo Bukit Rimau start from RM 464.\n\n##### What are the rental prices in Geo Bukit Rimau?\n\nRental prices in Geo Bukit Rimau start from RM 1,400.\n\n##### What is the address of Geo Bukit Rimau?\n\nGeo Bukit Rimau is located at Jalan Sungai Burung 32/68, Selangor.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProperties for Ren